{"gems":{"name":"solid_queue-listen_notify","downloads":1267,"version":"0.5.2","version_created_at":"2026-07-28T15:21:02.756Z","version_downloads":100,"platform":"ruby","authors":"Carl Mercier","info":"A database trigger notifies Solid Queue workers the moment a job becomes ready, so jobs start in milliseconds even with polling intervals raised to seconds or minutes — which cuts the idle query load that polling generates by orders of magnitude. No monkey patches: the gem wires itself in through Solid Queue's documented lifecycle hooks. Polling remains the correctness backstop, and every failure mode — missing trigger, non-Postgres adapter, PgBouncer, a dropped connection, a fork — degrades loudly to stock Solid Queue behavior.","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"homepage_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","documentation_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/README.md","rubygems_mfa_required":"true"},"yanked":false,"sha":"257b98e4c9210353b42a48bb52de9b5ffb818d3029e19d0b39d8cc1f0113a16a","spec_sha":"08875c3b9fad183c6b9cc5d62b8f8963bd96314c1c8dfdeb16d4fcf104a5e5e5","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/solid_queue-listen_notify","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/solid_queue-listen_notify-0.5.2.gem","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/README.md","mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/issues","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/cmer/solid_queue-listen_notify/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","funding_uri":null,"dependencies":{"development":[],"runt